From c6b5f2bc34dfa083c7ff10b4f04ca7752aefc6fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Wels <awels@redhat.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 07:27:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Fix utility volume attachment pod lifecycle during hotplug

Keep utility volume mounts when expanding attachment pods and only
delete the old pod once the replacement is running with the same PVCs.

Rebase insertion context onto Azure Linux's existing fallback-cleanup
backport without changing the upstream implementation or regression tests.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Signed-off-by: Alexander Wels <awels@redhat.com>
---
